          "zh-TW": "中午有很多客人。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "story_010_pattern_02",
      "name_en": "Connect contrasting ideas",
      "pattern_th": "action + แต่ + contrasting description",
      "explanation_en": "แต่ means but. Work quickly while still being careful.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "th": "เราทำงานเร็วแต่ระวัง",
          "en": "We work quickly but carefully.",
          "zh-TW": "我們動作很快，但仍小心。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "story_010_pattern_03",
      "name_en": "Describe a decrease",
      "pattern_th": "subject + น้อยลง",
      "explanation_en": "น้อยลง means less or fewer than before.",
